'''Karmine Corp''' (previously known as ''Kameto Corp'') and occasionally abbreviated as '''KCorp''' is a [[:Category:France|French]] multi-gaming esports organization created by [[leagueoflegends:Kameto|Kameto]].  The team currently hosts teams in ''League of Legends'', ''Rocket League'', and ''VALORANT''.

